        "pf_741baf9a_value": "We are committed to delighting each customer of ThePhotoStick. We are so confident you will love it, that we offer a no-risk 60-Day Money Back Guarantee, starting at the day of delivery.<br><br>Try out ThePhotoStick for PC and Mac computers, or ThePhotoStick Mobile for iPhone or Android smartphones, with no risk! If you have any issues and are not completely satisfied with your purchase for whatever reason, simply contact returns@thephotostick.com or visit our Live Chat support at thephotostick.com.",
        "pf_9812a894_value": "Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!\n\nSupported Android devices:\n\nCompatible with all Samsung, LG, Motorola, and HTC phones running Android OS 4.4 or newer made in the last 3 years. Phones must be OTG compatible. A FREE adapter is included that ensures compatibility with Micro-USB and USB-C devices.\n\nSupported iOS devices:\n\nCompatible with all iPhones, iPads, and iPod Touches that have a Lightning Port. Requires iOS 9.0 or later.",
        "pf_715ae19f_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Wow this is wonderful!<br></span><br>Wow this is wonderful. I was very surprised. I had over 3500 photos on my phone and was very worried about loosing them. So many memories.... the Photostick mobile was so easy to use and I plan on purchasing for my family for gifts. - <a href=\"https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/6046a3dff85d750394249ad1\" target=\"_blank\">Alice</a><br>",
        "pf_cc51ee29_value": "✅ Easy To Use – Custom designed file-backup App is easy to understand regardless of your smartphone knowledge.<br><br>✅ Works on Android, iPhone, iPad, and iPod Touch<br><br>✅ Easily Transfer To Your Computer –<br>Keep your files stored on ThePhotoStick® Mobile or easily plug it into a USB port to transfer everything to your computer.<br><br>Don’t Risk Losing Your Memories In The Cloud!<br>",
        "pf_dbc8fca0_value": "By simply plugging in ThePhotoStick® Mobile to your computer, you can easily transfer all the photos and videos off the device. It’s compatible with nearly all modern computers using Windows and Mac Operating Systems:<br><br>Windows:<br>Windows XP, Windows Vista, Windows 7, Windows 8, Windows 8.1, and Windows 10.<br><br>Mac:<br>Mac OS X Version 10.6 and later.",
        "pf_6aa07023_value": "It’s as easy as 1,2,3!<br><br>1. Download and Launch the FREE “ThePhotoStick® Mobile” App<br>2. Plug in the device<br>3. Click “Backup Now”<br><br>(optional) Plug into your computer to get the photos and videos off your device!",
        "pf_a6f7de6d_value": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick® Mobile in weekly and do a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.",
        "pf_758e331b_value": "We ship orders out FAST, but we can’t control carrier transit times. Due to COVID-19, orders are taking up to 10-20 days to be delivered depending on the country.<br><br>",
        "pf_c90cd249_value": "ThePhotoStick® Mobile is a small device that instantly backs up your priceless memories WITHOUT the frustration of searching and organizing them yourself!",
        "pf_b8bbd0f7_value": "Depending on your country, it is possible that you will be charged one or more of these fees when you receive your order.<br><br>",
        "pf_90b39485_alt": "Amazon Payments, American Express, Apple Pay, Diner's Club, Discover, JCB, Master Card, PayPal, and Visa",
        "pf_4ae2db3d_value": "All products are backed by our 60 Day Money Back Guarantee, starting on the day of shipping.",
        "pf_7d15b8bb_label": "Will I have to pay any additional customs, duties or VAT fees when I receive my order?",
        "pf_b8d3c733_label": "What photo file size is used when we say the 128GB version can store 60,000 photos?",
        "pf_5b0ae0f5_value": "Save hours of time searching – back up 1,000s of photos and videos in minutes!<br>",
        "pf_0a993ce6_value": "Quickly back up new files weekly and ensure you never lose any memories!<br>",
        "pf_59898c2b_value": "Searches your ENTIRE phone to ensure no picture or video is ever missed!<br>",
        "pf_29c8ed71_value": "Up to 128GB storage capacity – easily back up 60,000 photos and videos!<br>",
        "pf_158c8cac_value": "ThePhotoStick® Mobile Backs Up Your Precious Memories – Automatically!<br>",
        "pf_7e0a2274_value": "Never worry about losing files in the cloud or to water damage again!<br>",
        "pf_a26b61df_value": "Simply plug it in to your phone and hit ‘Backup Now’ on the FREE App!<br>",
